Nancy yells them to go back but they do

00:02:43.900 --> 00:02:47.680
not listen suddenly one of the surface

00:02:45.760 --> 00:02:49.750
is attacked by a shark and eaten amidst

00:02:47.680 --> 00:02:51.670
his screams the other local server

00:02:49.750 --> 00:02:53.140
he swims towards Nancy he eventually

00:02:51.670 --> 00:02:54.880
